attribution: Words and music by Charles K. Harris (died 1930); published by Charles K. Harris & Co., Milwaukee, in 1892 and sung in "A Trip to Chinatown", it became the first Tin Pan Alley song to sell millions of copies. Public domain: published before 1931 (United States) and all authors died before 1972 (Canada).
