melody:
# Refrain
Af-ter the ball is o-ver, af-ter the break of morn,
B4 D5. B4/ G4(2) E4 G4(3) D4(3) B4 D5. B4/ G4(2) E4 F#4(3) ~F#4(3)
af-ter the dan-cers' leav-ing, af-ter the stars are gone,
C5 E5. C5/ B4(2) A4 G#4(3) A4(3) A4 B4. A4/ F#4(2) D4 D5(3) ~D5(3)
man-y a heart is ach-ing, if you could read them all;
B4 D5. B4/ G4(2) E4 G4(3) D4(3) E4 G#4. B4/ E5(2) D5 C#5(3) ~C#5(3)
man-y the hopes that have van-ished af-ter the ball.
D5 A4 A4 A4 B4 C5 B4(3) D4(3) E4(3) F#4(2) D4 G4(3) ~G4 r(2)

